and have built long-term relationships with a number of them. For example, we have been a supplier to Nissin Medical Industries Co., Ltd
(&#8220;Nissin&#8221;), our largest dealer and sole distributor in Japan, since 2006. Despite the number of dealers we work with, the
majority of our sales, or approximately 58.6%, 47.6%, and 69.8% of our revenues for the fiscal years ended September 30, 2025, 2024 and
