to adjust wheelchair functions according to their individual conditions. Our wheelchairs designed under this concept have won a number
of design awards in China, including the Changzhou Science and Technology Progress Award in 2012, the Wujin District Science and Technology
Progress Award in 2012, the Silver Award of the First Industrial Design Competition of Jiangsu Province in 2013, and the CF Silver Award
