NACTUS-MS, GRA-FIT-RIR care-type wheelchair, NA-SUG1, etc. are some of the wheelchair models. As of the date of this Annual Report, we
are in the process of evaluating the markets and viability of these new products by introducing them to a few selected dealers in different
regions.</p><div>


</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">We are led by a management team with extensive experience in R&amp;D,
