</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">We believe the success of our business depends
heavily on offering innovative wheelchair products that achieves high customer satisfaction; therefore, we plan to continue to focus on
driving business growth through continuous product innovation. To stay at the forefront of innovation, we will continue to invest significant
