build business networks and promote our products in foreign markets. As of the date of this Annual Report, we have relationships with
more than twenty dealers in foreign markets outside of Japan and China, including the United States, Canada, Australia, Korea, Israel,
and Singapore, established in distribution agreements or through the fulfillment of orders made by these dealers.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>&#160;</i></b></p><div>

