</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>Legal Proceedings</b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">We are currently not a party to any material legal
or administrative proceedings. We may from time to time be subject to various legal or administrative claims and proceedings arising in
the ordinary course of business. Litigation or any other legal or administrative proceeding, regardless of the outcome, is likely to result
in substantial cost and diversion of our resources, including our management&#8217;s time and attention.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p><div>

