</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Cost of revenue and related tax from wheelchair
components increased by $38,542, or 3.9%, from $984,566 for the year ended September 30, 2024 to $1,023,108 for the year ended September
30, 2025. The increase in cost of revenue and related tax from wheelchair components was largely in line with the increase in revenue
from wheelchair components.</p><div>

