</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">We generate revenue primarily from wheelchair
products, wheelchair components and other products such as living aids products, as well as healthcare products, and these products are
sold in Japan, China and other countries. Our wheelchair products consist primarily of manual wheelchairs. Our products also consist of
living aids products such as oxygen concentrators, bath aids, rehabilitative devices and shared healthcare products and related infrastructures,
as well as healthcare products including micro hyperbaric chambers and scientific cosmetic products. Total revenue increased by $3,680,553,
or 18.6%, from $19,821,457 for the year ended September 30, 2023 to $23,502,010 for the year ended September 30, 2024.</p><div>

