</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The gross profit of wheelchair components decreased
by $476,648, or 34.6%, from $1,375,843 for the year ended September 30, 2023 to $899,195 for the year ended September 30, 2024, which
was due to the decrease in revenue from wheelchair components. The gross margin remained relatively stable with a slighted decrease of
2.0% from 49.7% for the year ended September 30, 2023 to 47.7% for the year ended September 30, 2024.</p><div>

