of the financial department at Changzhou Servo Motor Co., Ltd.; and from August 1992 to December 1995, he served as a financial officer
at Changzhou BMW Group. Mr. Wang graduated from Hangzhou Institute of Electronic Technology with a Bachelor&#8217;s degree in Industrial
Management in 1992, and was certified as a Senior Economist by the Department of Human Resources and Social Security of Jiangsu Province
in 2013.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Ms. Yanru Guo is an independent director. Ms.
