    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">the Ordinary Share transferred is fully paid and free of any lien in
    favor of us;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">(e)</span></td>
    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">any fee related to the transfer has been paid to us; and</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">(f)</span></td>
    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">the transfer is not to more than four joint holders.</span></td></tr>
