<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>&#160;</i></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">JIN MEDICAL INTERNATIONAL LTD. (&#8220;Jin Med&#8221;
or the &#8220;Company&#8221;) was established under the laws of the Cayman Islands on January 14, 2020 as a holding company.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Jin Med owns&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c64" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByParent" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-25083">100</ix:nonFraction>% equity interest of Zhongjin
International Limited (&#8220;Zhongjin HK&#8221;), an entity incorporated on February 25, 2020 in accordance with the laws and regulations
in Hong Kong.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Erhua Medical Technology (Changzhou) Co., Ltd.
(&#8220;Erhua Med&#8221;) was formed on September 24, 2020, as a Wholly Foreign-Owned Enterprise (&#8220;WFOE&#8221;) in the People&#8217;s
Republic of China (&#8220;PRC&#8221;). Zhongjin HK owns&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c65" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByParent" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-25084">100</ix:nonFraction>% equity interest of Erhua Med.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Jin Med, Zhongjin HK and Erhua Med are currently
