<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Changzhou Zhongjin Medical Co., Ltd. (&#8220;Changzhou Zhongjin&#8221;)
